  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "On the sixth day, I heard the curate drinking in the dark.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 3.87
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "My hand found the bottle.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 5.583,
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "We wrestled until the bottle burst on the bricks.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 8.583,
      "seconds": 3.18
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I let go, panting.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.463,
      "seconds": 1.75
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I stood between him and the food, and told him a discipline began now.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 14.75,
      "seconds": 4.46
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nothing more for him today.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 20.458,
      "seconds": 2.12
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I split what the pantry held into ten piles: ten days, if we kept to them.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 23.083,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A night and a day we sat facing each other.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 29.083,
      "seconds": 3.59
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He wept with hunger; I fought off sleep.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 33.583,
      "seconds": 3.26
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "For two days I beat him, coaxed him, even bribed him with wine.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 37.458,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Neither force nor kindness reached him.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 43.333,
      "seconds": 3.67
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I understood: he was mad.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 47.703,
      "seconds": 2.68
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "By the eighth day he spoke aloud.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 50.917,
      "seconds": 2.61
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "It is just, O God! We have sinned, we have fallen short.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 54.042,
      "seconds": 7.06
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Be still!",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 61.625,
      "seconds": 1.04
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He had threatened to cry out and call the Martians down on us.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 63.365,
      "seconds": 3.96
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He rose to his knees.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 67.833,
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "I have been still too long, and now I must bear my witness.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 70.208,
      "seconds": 5.18
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Shut up! For God's sake!",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 75.917,
      "seconds": 2.7
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had sprung up, sick with fear of the pit.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 79.317,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He stood and threw his arms wide.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 83.042,
      "seconds": 3.23
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "Nay! Speak! The word of the Lord is upon me!",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 87.292,
      "seconds": 3.9
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He cried out his witness, and three strides carried him to the kitchen door.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 91.708,
      "seconds": 5.2
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "My hand found the meat chopper on the wall.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 97.417,
      "seconds": 3.11
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Fear made me fierce.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 101.227,
      "seconds": 2.04
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Halfway across the kitchen I caught him, and struck him with the chopper's butt.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 103.792,
      "seconds": 4.58
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then plaster ran outside, and the hole went dark.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 108.875,
      "seconds": 3.61
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A handling machine slid across the gap. I stood frozen.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 113.0,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A Martian's dark eyes peered through glass. A tentacle came feeling in.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 118.0,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It dragged the curate toward the light and studied his head.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 123.5,
      "seconds": 4.26
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The pit had heard him.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 128.46,
      "seconds": 1.53
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I fled to the coal cellar and buried myself in coal.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 130.5,
      "seconds": 3.75
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Something fumbled at the latch.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 134.75,
      "seconds": 2.68
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The Martians understood doors.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 138.13,
      "seconds": 2.62
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It swayed over the coal like a blind black worm.",
      "shot": 27,
      "at": 141.25,
      "seconds": 3.73
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It touched the heel of my boot.",
      "shot": 28,
      "at": 145.5,
      "seconds": 2.03
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I bit my hand.",
      "shot": 28,
      "at": 148.23,
      "seconds": 1.15
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A click. It had only taken a lump of coal.",
      "shot": 29,
      "at": 149.917,
      "seconds": 3.39
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I lay buried all the tenth day, and dared not stir until the eleventh.",
      "shot": 31,
      "at": 158.25,
      "seconds": 4.5
    }
  ],
  "plan": "fa607751b3b0ef16"
}